    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Meow Path 2</strong> <strong>An adorable puzzle adventure that will keep you hooked!</strong> Draw lines to cover every area in the world of cute kitties, but beware! Various obstacles are ready to challenge your puzzle-solving skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You'll Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>125+ carefully crafted levels</strong> with intricate design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>500+ side levels</strong> for challenge seekers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More challenging and mentally engaging than the first game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 adorable cat characters</strong> with unique designs and random selection system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>500+ cat image collection</strong> that will captivate you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ types of obstacles</strong> in <strong>20+ different patterns</strong> for unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously designed paths that never feel repetitive, both challenging and relaxing at the same time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No language during gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Level Editor</strong> - Create your own levels and share files with friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725130/extras/caa543210a02ce3183f23ca3bff758bc.poster.avif?t=1755178778\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725130/extras/caa543210a02ce3183f23ca3bff758bc.webm?t=1755178778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725130/extras/caa543210a02ce3183f23ca3bff758bc.mp4?t=1755178778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for an adventure with the kitties in &quot;Meow Path 2&quot;\u00a0</strong>A puzzle game that will challenge your planning and problem-solving abilities while delivering endless cute and entertaining experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf1f Start your adventure and unlock the secrets of the cat world! \ud83c\udf1f</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Meow Path 2</strong> <strong>An adorable puzzle adventure that will keep you hooked!</strong> Draw lines to cover every area in the world of cute kitties, but beware! Various obstacles are ready to challenge your puzzle-solving skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You'll Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>125+ carefully crafted levels</strong> with intricate design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>500+ side levels</strong> for challenge seekers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More challenging and mentally engaging than the first game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 adorable cat characters</strong> with unique designs and random selection system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>500+ cat image collection</strong> that will captivate you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ types of obstacles</strong> in <strong>20+ different patterns</strong> for unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously designed paths that never feel repetitive, both challenging and relaxing at the same time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No language during gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Level Editor</strong> - Create your own levels and share files with friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725130/extras/caa543210a02ce3183f23ca3bff758bc.poster.avif?t=1755178778\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725130/extras/caa543210a02ce3183f23ca3bff758bc.webm?t=1755178778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725130/extras/caa543210a02ce3183f23ca3bff758bc.mp4?t=1755178778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for an adventure with the kitties in &quot;Meow Path 2&quot;\u00a0</strong>A puzzle game that will challenge your planning and problem-solving abilities while delivering endless cute and entertaining experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf1f Start your adventure and unlock the secrets of the cat world! \ud83c\udf1f</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to &quot;Meow Path 2&quot; - a charming and challenging 2D adventure puzzle game! Dive into a world filled with adorable cats that will take you on an exciting puzzle-solving experience in every level. Get ready for a journey of endless fun and entertainment with these meow-velous felines!",
